{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_011MuZonDbg9wrTYGx35uAJ7","type":"tool_result","content":"release/skills/shadcn/SKILL.md:7:[Omitted long matching line]\nrelease/skills/design-process/SKILL.md:18:5. **Test and approve desktop wireframes.** Test tasks, capture issues, revise, obtain explicit structure approval for each page/template. Do not start Step 6 without it.\nrelease/skills/design-process/SKILL.md:20:7. **Mobile and tablet.** Only after desktop approval and when the brief says Step 7; document reflow, navigation, touch, keyboard and focus behavior."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f0bd072d-d495-4454-a967-3e00aaf8b556","uuid":"5010c4b7-df13-4321-a2ce-ef3bd5f49bf3","timestamp":"2026-10-18T02:58:07.226Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"release/skills/shadcn/SKILL.md:7:[Omitted long matching line]\nrelease/skills/design-process/SKILL.md:18:5. **Test and approve desktop wireframes.** Test tasks, capture issues, revise, obtain explicit structure approval for each page/template. Do not start Step 6 without it.\nrelease/skills/design-process/SKILL.md:20:7. **Mobile and tablet.** Only after desktop approval and when the brief says Step 7; document reflow, navigation, touch, keyboard and focus behavior.","numLines":3,"totalLines":3},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_011MuZonDbg9wrTYGx35uAJ7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
